    "Target69 listener is selected by the exact mark rectangle, not just x. Shared x values exist at different y. Audience-edge9 is separate and unique.",
    "Register smaller hardware targets before the broad PA base. Actors must not steal clicks from active props or exits; visual occlusion remains natural.",
    "Draw background, floor marks, cart, cable, console, tape, selector, socket, microphone, speaker, slate, then font0 labels attached to selector, then actors sorted by feet depth, finally captions/HUD. Actors may temporarily occlude controls; full target-priority remains active.",
    "Font0 labels need native font0 6x8 at specified origins. Exact written credit is displayed via text205 record and is not fabricated as tiny raster writing.",
    "Use source text205 . . . fallback for written three-dot inspection; on-world identical badge art has three visible dots.",
    "Approach coordinates are collision-free floor points y135..140. Stage cannot extend into HUD row144. Caption panel covers0..43; essential controls begin57.",
